+# KEO native readiness scope - private candidate, 04.11.2026
+
+Baseline local5f68039. Actual EXE SHA256504b362cde850d56afb1cea6f5b7b0ee014d9dd7b47e188599d91c804502cd3e.
+The coordinates getter3AB4F0 was shared by loading, AI/grounding, building
+and spawning callers. Old step3 promoted native false totrue for unknown cells
+when global section count waszero. This is a reproduced native-boundary policy
+defect; it is not a reproduced specific shopkeeper displacement or duplicate squad.
+
+The only confirmed direct loading caller is processLoading'sA0EA8B (returnA0EA90)
+through zone wrapper3AC810 and its inner coordinates call3AC81D (return3AC822).
+The same processLoading body invokes delayedSpawningChecks, so a whole-driver
+TLS bracket or global state4 test would also authorize spawning incorrectly.
+
+Prepare validates seven actual byte windows before any readiness hook is patched.
+Optional wrapper row is in the hook manifest. Paired startup capability requires
+both originals and intact inner call bytes. Unknown/changed hook chains fall
+back to native readiness. A relocated call can disable acceleration safely;
+actual MinHook routing remains a game acceptance check.
+
+The wrapper captures _ReturnAddress in the detour, enters a POD TLS frame,
+masks outer permission even for unrelated nested wrappers, and restores in
+__finally. The getter consumes the positive token BEFORE calling native original;
+first mismatch also consumes. Manager,zone+24,return address all match exactly.
+Native true remains true. Native false outside the exact loading poll returns
+before expensive readiness classification and never receives the queue bypass.
+Absolute return addresses are cached at startup; no GameAddr linear scan in
+the hot wrapper. OFF startup does not query the private profile. No heap,
+logging, lock, new thread, retained world pointer or per-frame INI read added.
+
+Verification:
+-253 actual pure-policy controls each VC10/Od and/O2; five compiled mutations
+ rejected; actual124 EXE bytes, overflow, thread separation,C++/SEH tested.
+-22586 extracted-production checks/4608 cases each/Od and/O2; native originals
+ called once, native true/false, all caller classes, options, cell classes,
+ nesting, exact args, capability/profile failures, OFF/noquery/noheap checked.
+ Legacy5f68039 fails the ambient-spawn negative control for the intended reason.
+-Independent review found hot GameAddr and OFF profile reads; both corrected.
+-Full DEV and PROD:342 actual sources each, BUILD_CACHE=off,VC10/GL/LTCG.
+ Both x64/startPlugin and144 KenshiLib0.5.0 imports pass.
+
+Only tests/native build are accepted. Runtime loading, exact hook-chain behavior,
+NPC positions/population, route quality,FPS and long-session lifetime await game
+comparison. This does not repair ambient population weighting, prove GOG support
+or replace the author's routing algorithm. No public version bump/publication.
+Map and DF remain paused. Existing personal INI must be preserved.
